From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:20:53 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] regini: apply registry script files (3294)

regini was a stub. It now applies script files: kernel registry paths (and
HKEY_* spellings), subkeys by indentation, "name = REG_xx data" for every
registry type, quoted names/strings, ';' comments, '\' continuation, value
DELETE, key DELETE, "key name = data" on one line, ANSI / UTF-8 / UTF-16
files, and the applied changes are echoed. Bad lines are reported and the exit
status is 1; the other lines are still applied. -m and -h are refused.

